// "Trading spellcasting for martial might, strike harder, weather heavier
// blows" -- `Reckless` (damage-up/vulnerability-up) stands in for the
// martial-power-swap, same substitution shillelagh.ron already established
// for a comparable weapon-empowerment buff.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Reckless, data: BuffData(strength: 0.3, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 115.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 6 spell -> min_level 36, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(36)),
    ),
)
